    84	The  anatomical  images  were  preprocessed  using  the  SPM12  (htt p://www.fil.ion.ucl.ac.uk/spm) toolbox. The pre-processing steps included  segmentation,  bias-correction,  and  normalization  using  the DARTEL  algorithm  (Ashburner,  2007).  The  segmented  white  matter images were modulated and resampled into 1.5 × 1.5 × 1.5 mm. Finally, quality controls of all images were conducted before further statistical analysis.
